00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:26.400
We will unpack that, but let's start off

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:27.599
with some background on you, please,

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.119
Kyle.

00:00:27.599 --> 00:00:31.119
>> Yeah. Uh, I grew up in Northern

00:00:29.119 --> 00:00:32.480
Michigan, small town called Gaylord. Um,

00:00:31.119 --> 00:00:34.320
my father was a golf course

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:36.320
superintendent. So, [snorts] being

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:38.480
around golf was my life, you know, since

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:40.559
as long as I can remember. And that kind

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:42.719
of fed into playing junior golf, high

00:00:40.559 --> 00:00:44.160
school golf. Um, kind of dabbled, you

00:00:42.719 --> 00:00:45.600
know, in the kind of the amateur thing

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:47.680
for just a little bit, but not long

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.360
