00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:52.160
anything like that. and uh just dove

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:54.480
right into a career in golf where you

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:56.000
know right out of college I have been

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:57.920
assisting other people in running golf

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:59.760
courses until I was able to run my own

00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:01.600
