00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:15.760
>> Yeah. So uh upon graduation you know I

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:17.439
began the assistant golf professional

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:19.439
track. I was at Kent Country Club in

00:01:17.439 --> 00:01:21.280
Grand Rapids, Michigan. Um, and then

00:01:19.439 --> 00:01:22.560
from there I got uh the assistant golf

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:24.240
professional job at Sleepy Hollow

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:27.119
Country Club just north of New York

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:29.280
City. Um, which I felt like it was the

00:01:27.119 --> 00:01:32.159
big break that I needed, you know, to be

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:35.040
around a very high level golf club. Uh,

00:01:32.159 --> 00:01:37.119
and I parlayed that into an assistant

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:39.600
job at Northfield Golf Club south of

00:01:37.119 --> 00:01:41.920
Minneapolis, Minnesota. And that led

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:44.720
into my first leap from being an

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:47.360
assistant to straight to GM. I never

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:49.520
didn't even do the head pro route. Um I

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:51.119
