00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:53.360
never looked back. So I spent three

00:01:51.119 --> 00:01:55.920
years there, spent three years at Quil

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:58.159
Ridge Golf Club and then uh I left to go

00:01:55.920 --> 00:02:00.719
