00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:15.200
years upon buying the golf course and

00:02:12.959 --> 00:02:17.280
continuing to operate in the general

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:20.080
manager role.

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:22.319
Okay, great. So, that last piece there

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:27.680
