00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:43.200
>> Yep. Yep. Me and the golf course

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:44.879
superintendent as co-owners.

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:47.760
>> Exactly. So you and the superintendent

00:02:44.879 --> 00:02:49.680
are 50/50 owners in the business. We're

00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:54.560
we're going to get to that as well.

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:56.800
>> Okay. So you're the GM of Quail Ridge in

00:02:54.560 --> 00:03:01.040
2013. So, how does the prospect of

00:02:56.800 --> 00:03:03.040
buying the place start?

00:03:01.040 --> 00:03:05.360
>> Uh, yeah, it started with a conversation

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:09.200
with the previous ownership um about

00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:11.440
their desire to potentially sell. Uh,

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:13.040
and they had already had conversations

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:15.200
