00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:22.800
bidder, see what happens. Um, but since

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:25.920
the golf course superintendent had been

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:28.000
there since 1998, I got there in 2015,

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:30.239
they they felt that they wanted us to

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:33.519
buy it if we were in a position to do

00:03:30.239 --> 00:03:35.440
