00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:46.239
>> What was that those first conversations

00:03:44.799 --> 00:03:48.480
like? They approached you.

00:03:46.239 --> 00:03:50.799
>> They did. Yeah. Just off the cuff

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:53.120
