00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:23.680
the conversation of this seems more like

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:25.759
a question of can you do this? Is this

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:28.080
something you want to do? And then from

00:04:25.759 --> 00:04:30.080
there, how do you do it?

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:32.320
>> You said you had thought about this in

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:32.960
your dreams. So is this a dream come

00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:36.400
true?

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:38.160
>> Yeah, absolutely. Yeah. to be able to to

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:41.199
own a golf course and know that

00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:44.240
everything that my staff and myself and

00:04:41.199 --> 00:04:47.199
and uh Tim, our co-owner, put into it,

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:49.840
we control our own destiny rather than

00:04:47.199 --> 00:04:52.160
having to, you know, work really hard,

00:04:49.840 --> 00:04:56.080
which most people do, um for somebody

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:57.759
else. Uh and that is that is how a lot

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:59.600
of people make their living and I

00:04:57.759 --> 00:05:01.919
understand that. But it it definitely

00:04:59.600 --> 00:05:04.720
changes your perspective on how you

00:05:01.919 --> 00:05:06.560
operate when

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:08.240
you know everything you put into it is

00:05:06.560 --> 00:05:10.320
if you if you make too many crucial

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:11.600
mistakes, you're the one that suffers,

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:16.160
