00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:07.440
>> And so, this place was founded by 23

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:09.680
people or or invested in by 23 people.

00:06:07.440 --> 00:06:11.840
Were these

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:15.440
golf entrepreneurs or were they just

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:17.199
golf afficionados who had day jobs, were

