primary fiveorities?

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:31.680
>> Three. Yeah, at that point I guess there

00:06:30.639 --> 00:06:32.880
was eight because one of them had

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:35.199
passed.

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:37.840
>> Okay. [snorts] So, so just say more

00:06:35.199 --> 00:06:40.000
about kind of the the the vision here,

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:41.759
what they built, how it was

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:44.000
>> structure. So, kind of a kind of a brief

00:06:41.759 --> 00:06:45.680
timeline and also various conversations

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:49.120
throughout the years I knew some of

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:51.360
these owners was 1998 was in the middle

